/-!
# An involutive square-zero algebra

This module develops a four-dimensional complex algebra generated by an involution and an
anticommuting square-zero element. It constructs and classifies the two signed simple modules and
the two corresponding indecomposable projective modules, computes their morphism matrix, and
decomposes the regular module.
-/


